.Dd October 4, 2026
.Dt AIRPLANE-MODE-TOGGLE 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm airplane-mode-toggle
.Nd toggle airplane mode
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
runs
.Xr airplane-mode 1
.Cm toggle .
The usual chords are
.Sy Super+A
and the radio key.
.Sh EXIT STATUS
The exit status is that of
.Xr airplane-mode 1 .
